window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What do you do when the person you are bonded to eternally has betrayed you?<br> Simple.<br> You make his life hell.<br> As the Shadow Prince’s secrets finally unravel, I’m left scrambling to pick up the pieces.<br> Hiding in another kingdom might fix all my problems, right?<br> My mate will be left in the darkness this time.<br> I hope those shadows choke him.</p> <p>Let the games begin.</p> <p><b><i>FORETOLD is book 2 in the FATED LOVE series, a gripping, sexy, romantic fantasy series by Chantal Fernando.</i></b></p>"; 
